win32: export batched IOCP completion APIs

Both APIs have been available since Windows Vista. Keep rebuilt distributions
consistent with the bundled kernel32 import definition. No compiler rebuild is
needed to use the new exports in an existing distribution.

--- a/win32/lib/kernel32.def
+++ b/win32/lib/kernel32.def
@@ -341,6 +341,7 @@
 GetProfileStringA
 GetProfileStringW
 GetQueuedCompletionStatus
+GetQueuedCompletionStatusEx
 GetSLCallbackTarget
 GetSLCallbackTemplate
 GetShortPathNameA
@@ -637,6 +638,7 @@
 SetFileApisToOEM
 SetFileAttributesA
 SetFileAttributesW
+SetFileCompletionNotificationModes
 SetFilePointer
 SetFilePointerEx
 SetFileTime
